    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs can personalize learning by adapting to students’ pace and style, offering step-by-step explanations for tough topics. They can also generate practice problems tailored to individual needs, making math more engaging and less intimidating for diverse learners."
